		"Squad recruitable", "me sells everything", "Squad loads", "Squad towards Oil in [Skirmish]EnemyOuterPerimeter", "Tank towards Oil in Gate", "Tank trapped with BoobyTrap", "Squad trapped with BoobyTrap",
		"Squad uses Command_Frenzy", "Squad uses Command_ConstructAmericaVehicleScoutDrone 50%", "Squad hunts with Command_RangerCaptureBuilding",
