		"Squad use Command_Snipe on nearest 0 -1 ", "Squad use Command_Clear on nearest 1 -1 ", "Squad use Command_Hack on nearest 2 7 ",
		"Squad use Command_RangerCaptureBuilding on nearest 3 -1 ", "Squad use Command_RangerCaptureBuilding on nearest 4 9 ",
